  "sort": 900000,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can imbue yourself with the might of giants. As a Bonus Action, you magically gain the following benefits for 1 minute. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><ul><li>If you are smaller than Large, you become Large, along with anything you are wearing. If you lack the room, your size doesn't change.</li><li>You have Advantage on Strength checks and Strength saving throws.</li><li>Once on each of your turns, one of your attacks with a weapon or an Unarmed Strike can deal an extra 1d6 damage to a target on a hit (1d8 at Fighter level 10, 1d10 at level 18).</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
